                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 13815/32.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dodge to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Dodge acknowledges telegram of June 18 and reports Oxley and Meyers detained
                    six days. Says the detention limit will not affect the detention of the Bailey
                    party.</p>
            </div>
